    "resumed_from_research_run_id": "",
    "resumed_from_checkpoint_no": null,
    "status": "COMPLETED",
    "completion_terminal_state": "COMPLETED_VERIFIED",
    "final_report_title": "研究报告：Java 虚拟线程在哪个 JDK 版本正式发布，synchronized 导致的线程固定问题在哪个版本改善？引用 JEP。",
    "final_report_markdown": "# Java 虚拟线程的正式发布与 synchronized 固定问题改善\n\nJava 虚拟线程（JEP 444）在 JDK 21 中成为全平台正式功能，此前自 JDK 19 起一直处于预览阶段。synchronized 导致的固定问题由 JEP 491（Synchronize Virtual Threads without Pinning）改善。其成因是 JVM 为实现 synchronized 关键字所记录的是持有对象监视器的平台线程而非虚拟线程，并主动阻止虚拟线程在 synchronized 方法内卸载。\n\n## 直接回答\n\n就正式发布的版本而言，本次核验的资料显示，JDK 21 的重要新功能当属虚拟线程（JEP 444）；自 JDK 19 以来虚拟线程一直是预览版功能，而在 JDK 21 中已成为全平台功能。 [evidence:30b2b2de005217855f53f80312727b46d5ef2b31bd6a96f5]\n\n就 synchronized 固定问题的改善而言，本次核验的资料显示，JEP 491 的目标即是让虚拟线程在 synchronized 中同步而不再被固定（Synchronize Virtual Threads without Pinning）。 [evidence:90be593c39c31d28c0655ea3a476077af66e269dc072f7d5]\n\n## 对比表\n\n| 关注点 | 相关 JEP | 核验资料中的说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 正式发布 | JEP 444 | JDK 21 中虚拟线程成为全平台功能，此前自 JDK 19 起为预览版 [evidence:30b2b2de005217855f53f80312727b46d5ef2b31bd6a96f5] |\n| synchronized 固定问题改善 | JEP 491 | 实现 Synchronize Virtual Threads without Pinning，使虚拟线程在 synchronized 中不再被固定 [evidence:90be593c39c31d28c0655ea3a476077af66e269dc072f7d5] |\n| 固定问题成因 | 未指明 | JVM 记录持有监视器的是平台线程而非虚拟线程，并主动阻止虚拟线程在 synchronized 方法内卸载 [evidence:df9a7e1a85090ec7a3e54d2456302499f555229f7fba4c61] [evidence:85b46665dd90359e057553bda602ca306a70a6ae230d833b] |\n\n## Citation audit\n\n### Java virtual threads · JEP and JDK version for virtual threads finalization\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:30b2b2de005217855f53f80312727b46d5ef2b31bd6a96f5`\n- Exact quote: “JDK 21 重要的新功能当属虚拟线程 ([JEP 444](https://openjdk.org/jeps/444))。自 JDK 19 以来，虚拟线程一直是预览版功能，而现在已成为全平台功能。”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/6a46285d-7ddf-4494-a5bc-fa499cca3b5b/4585b44427c4af55c8590b6361a570fb78356e94724cf2050da9df72cac7d2bf`\n- URL: https://www.azul.com/zh-hans/blog/jdk-21-delivers-virtual-threads-other-new-features-and-long-term-support/\n\n### Java virtual threads · JEP and JDK version fixing synchronized pinning\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:90be593c39c31d28c0655ea3a476077af66e269dc072f7d5`\n- Exact quote: “8338383: Implement JEP 491: Synchronize Virtual Threads without Pinning”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/17d4f495-b8db-4b48-aac2-ebdb08f18722/43bd2d5a8c70ca14df8c89666a2d0492524ed710523b23b4d33739693bd81af5`\n- URL: https://mail.openjdk.org/pipermail/core-libs-dev/2024-October/132952.html\n\n### Java virtual threads · Cause of synchronized pinning\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:df9a7e1a85090ec7a3e54d2456302499f555229f7fba4c61`\n- Exact quote: “To implement the `synchronized` keyword, the JVM tracks which thread currently holds an object's monitor. Unfortunately, it tracks which platform thread holds the monitor, not which virtual thread.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/17d4f495-b8db-4b48-aac2-ebdb08f18722/fb276e6efefd548d5929dd23c76ef0942b0da35dd6484b14c48e82eed2b49bc9`\n- URL: https://openjdk.org/jeps/491\n\n## 补充引用\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:85b46665dd90359e057553bda602ca306a70a6ae230d833b`\n  - Exact quote: “Accordingly, the JVM actively prevents a virtual thread from unmounting inside a `synchronized` method.”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/17d4f495-b8db-4b48-aac2-ebdb08f18722/fb276e6efefd548d5929dd23c76ef0942b0da35dd6484b14c48e82eed2b49bc9`\n  - URL: https://openjdk.org/jeps/491\n",
